<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Mass. Hlth &amp; Educ Fac Auth.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Mass. Hlth &amp; Educ Fac Auth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shattuck Hammond Partners, Inc. said it received the written award for the $12.615 million of Massachusetts Health &amp; Education Facilities Authority, revenue bonds, Series A, with a top yield of 6.25 percent in 2041.</p>
